            "review_title": "Review at Zee Zee Chicken House",
            "review_text": "Brian F\nRanders, Denmark551 contributions\n0\nFinally…..\nJan 2024 • Couples\n……after walking up and down some streets, this hidden gem appears. From the outside the place looks like a cafe / small diner. Forget it. Just entering the restaurant, we were taken upstairs to the most fantastic ambience and atmosphere. Outstanding service from the first minute. Great menu with fine variety. English speaking staff and menu.\n\nQuality, price and service more than add up. If ever back in Hanoi, then we will most certainly be back.\nRead more\nWritten January 11, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
