            "review_title": "Review at Zee Zee Chicken House",
            "review_text": "CCHSingapore\nSingapore, Singapore1069 contributions\n0\nLunch on a Hot Day\nJun 2023 • Solo\nI was making my way from one tourist spot to another when I chanced upon this restaurant. The name intrigued me and I found myself walking in. \n\nLunch was the Pumpkin Soup and Noodles with Chicken and Vegetables. The soup was tasty but I personally found the noodles a tad salty. The portions were adequate though. The service rendered was professional and non-intrusive. \n\nThe restaurant was empty, being a weekday afternoon, and I had the entire 2nd floor to myself.\nRead more\nWritten June 29, 2023",
